## §9 · FAILED-SOLUTIONS ELIMINATION (FS-##) — AV-02's Experience sequence, most-used first

M-1 here = LOCK-B UMP (the build sold as the finish line; the builder leaves at go-live) + the MK-07 ownership component 10 handed to 11 (the store held in the builder's account until transfer). Tried-only rule applied in code: records with `solution_status` NULL/CONSIDERING route to objections (FS-X2: Q-O-0028, Q-O-0135 → OBJ-04; Q-Y-0009 reviewer → SK). AV-02's order (09 experience + stacked characteristics): a store attempt or a "free store" offer → paid a builder/vendor → a coach or program → (separately) a money scheme that held her funds.

